\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Figure 1 and Supplementary Figure 1: Data Cleaning and Preparation Steps\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Figure 1 presents joinpoint regression analysis of monthly US deceased donor kidney transplant rates (January 2015\'96December 2024), stratified by donor mechanism of death: drug overdose, non-drug overdose, and overall. Supplementary Figure 1 presents the same analysis for the individual non-overdose decedent donor mechanisms of death: cardiovascular; gunshot wound; blunt injury; intracranial hemorrhage (ICH) or stroke; and others. Both figures use the same underlying data and cleaning steps described below. Crude rates are calculated per US resident population using the NCI Joinpoint Regression Program Version 5.4 (detailed settings in manuscript Methods section).\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

